    "slug": "weed-near-me-tourist-guide",
    "title": "Weed Near Me in Bangkok: A Tourist Guide to Legal Visits",
    "metaTitle": "Weed Near Me in Bangkok: Tourist Guide | DANK BKK",
    "description": "Tourists searching weed near me in Bangkok: what to bring, the age limit, the Thai prescription rule and what foreign cards do not cover. Visit in person.",
    "keyword": "weed near me",
    "date": "2027-02-25",
