    "slug": "weed-dispensary-thailand",
    "title": "What Is a weed dispensary in Thailand? Dispensary, Shop and Clinic Explained",
    "metaTitle": "weed dispensary in Thailand Explained | DANK BKK",
    "description": "What is a weed dispensary in Thailand, and how does it differ from a shop or clinic? Learn the consultation and prescription steps, then visit in person.",
    "keyword": "weed dispensary",
    "date": "2027-04-15",
